          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Lord, you have been our dwelling place for all generations.",
      "ko": "주여 주는 대대에 우리의 거처가 되셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "516541dc09f8b09f045010ffeeb5c5ae9b500235807c8f86ee11caee75fc7cfd",
      "translation_text_hash": "f378445d7b21fcb38872f891a37df9245cf80b6c6f8454e6557511e3b1862542",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "주여 주는 대대에 우리의 거처가 되셨나이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f378445d7b21fcb38872f891a37df9245cf80b6c6f8454e6557511e3b1862542"
      ]
