      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 90,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "Relent, LORD! How long? Have compassion on your servants!",
      "ko": "여호와여 돌아오소서 언제까지니이까 주의 종들을 긍휼히 여기소서",
      "source_text_hash": "d0724ce540c0834ff2b93feaa2d4a0754ddd150253739d24eaa8f7f9eca5f51e",
      "translation_text_hash": "951ed29de4bc9635632d0a294aa343fcc24eb47f8ef8c7cc6b976dcc9a473a47",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와여 돌아오소서 언제까지니이까 주의 종들을 긍휼히 여기소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "951ed29de4bc9635632d0a294aa343fcc24eb47f8ef8c7cc6b976dcc9a473a47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:90:14",
      "sequence": 15393,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 90",
      "verse_label": "14",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
